omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dBa8oXXyr7AQ7kNvwE8o59g&_nc_oc=Adpbee1lYHiHOd6bnNKl3HURKk5IEysRb2cpXPc4FUozzWdYhpaWIN9-LrjkSEcmHhI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5Vlr69s6RaIOC6kTK_t2-LJ-crII9oJUTWy3b6fSm5bg&oe=69FCAE34"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P7IsVzYofikQ7kNvwEA7eRU&_nc_oc=AdobDn-mnopCmxl6I7LjmzxHBdrYXbVZNsLqdtOAiq9KCwdbtqcRRgXaSyXJIdQN6gQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4MjBlV2uwh0bPhw_4jSUmlYRWEp-sYNmn9O4_mth6DPw&oe=69FCAF96"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0CuLm3DpuyoQ7kNvwGR0Xxi&_nc_oc=Adry4yM-TX88imtt3fiK7lV_fclzVt8O34IAlQj7LaGoqd70iifVrccqsD6od0YRDyk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7FuzVvUUVYhOC6hsAvq6CcYVrIakO5S3J_pxnCgMgNcg&oe=69FC8C77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://